FILE,LAD 2
SOR,0 XIC,I:1/0 XIO,T4:1/DN TON,T4:0,30 EOR,0
RCM,Blinker: with I:1/0 closed, T4:0 times 3 s and T4:1 another 2 s; T4:1/DN restarts the cycle.
SOR,1 XIC,T4:0/DN TON,T4:1,20 EOR,1
RCM,
SOR,2 XIC,T4:0/TT OTE,O:2/0 EOR,2
RCM,Lamp on while T4:0 is timing.
SOR,3 XIC,T4:0/DN CTU,C5:0,5 EOR,3
RCM,Counts complete cycles.
SOR,4 XIC,C5:0/DN OTE,O:2/1 EOR,4
RCM,After 5 cycles O:2/1 turns on.
SOR,5 XIC,I:1/1 RES,C5:0 EOR,5
RCM,I:1/1 resets the counter.
SOR,6 END,6
RCM,
SYMBOLS
I:1/0 Enable
I:1/1 Reset count
O:2/0 Lamp
O:2/1 Five cycles
